        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Angkor Wat</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1122 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Made by</span><span class="info-stat-val">Commissioned by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/khmer-empire">Khmer</a> king <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/suryavarman-ii">Suryavarman II</a> (ruled 1113–c. 1150) as his state temple, on the suggestion of Divākarapaṇḍita; built by Khmer architects and a labour force that probably ran into the thousands, including many highly skilled artisans</span></div>
